WEBVTT

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.230
Huh?

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.650
I see.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:22.730
It's over.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.850
Hi, nice to meet you,

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.940
Rudeus.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.400
Excuse me, but who are you?

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.900
Just what I look like.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.650
I can't get a good look at you.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:48.600
I'm a god. The Man-God.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.150
I see. The "Man-God."

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.980
I've been watching you.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:57.020
You're leading quite an
interesting life, aren't you?

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.270
A voyeur, huh?

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:03.600
Yes! You're funny, so I watch over you.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.310
I figured you'd need some help.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:09.020
I'm on your side.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.850
Ha! "My side"? That's rich!

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:16.060
You let me dream I got reborn
in another world, when it's really game over!

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.690
Was it fun watching me have a good time? Well?

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:20.850
I can't trust you one bit!

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:22.900
Oh, dear.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.100
Well, let me give you some advice for now.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.810
Oh, I've met people like you! In my old life.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.980
People who tempt me with "advice"!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.020
No, no.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.600
I'm past the point where
an attitude change could help me!

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.560
Positive thinking would just make
my despair come back worse than ever.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.650
Like right now!

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.900
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:48.020
I'm talking about now, not your past life.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:49.850
Huh?

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.600
Then why do I look like this?

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:55.020
That's your mental form. Your body is fine.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:59.980
So, when I wake up,
I won't be back in this shitty body?

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:04.810
Yes! When you wake up,
your body will be back to normal.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.940
I see.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.270
A dream.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.810
Yup.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:12.690
What a shock!

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:16.650
Your mental and physical
selves are so different!

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.150
So, what do you want me to do?

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:22.520
Go back to my world because I don't belong here?

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:24.060
Of course not.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:28.310
I can't send you anywhere outside
this Six-Sided World, anyway.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:29.440
Hmm.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:33.980
Meaning that you didn't make
me reincarnate into this world?

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.190
Well, no.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:38.650
The wicked Dragon-God's
better at that sort of thing.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.730
Wicked Dragon-God, huh?

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.310
So, will you hear me out?

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:44.190
Nope.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:45.480
Why not?!

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.600
You're fishy.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.520
Come on, trust me.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.850
At least just this first time.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:54.060
What, like "just the tip"?

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.060
You're out to trick me.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.650
Well, I give up.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:03.520
Still, as things are, you'll die.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.350
Die?

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:06.400
Why?

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.940
Well, the Demon Continent's a harsh land.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:13.850
There's barely any food
and a whole lot of monsters.

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:15.560
Think you can handle it?

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.060
Huh? Hang on. What do you mean?

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:22.980
You see, you got caught in a
massive mana disaster and transported.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:27.020
A "mana disaster"? You mean that light?

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.520
Are you confident?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.190
Confident you can survive
in a strange, dangerous land?

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.400
Fine! I get it.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.190
Tell me whatever! I can't stop you.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.060
Yes, yes.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.770
Now,

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:48.480
Rudeus,

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.440
listen well.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:55.350
When you wake up, there will be a man nearby.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:58.310
Rely on that man.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.230
And...

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:04.190
...help him.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.860
Mushoku Tensei: 
Jobless Reincarnation

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:43.850
Thank God.

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:52.100
Where's Ghislaine?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.350
Ghislaine?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.850
A Superd!

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.980
Good morning.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:36.020
Good morning.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.350
Did God send you?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.060
I don't understand your question.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:47.900
You two fell from the sky.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.400
Human children are frail.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.060
I made a fire to warm you.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.730
You--

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:56.770
You saved us, then.

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.730
Thank you.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:03.600
By the way, was there anyone else near us?

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:06.270
A beast-woman?

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:10.100
I only found the two of you.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.400
I see.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.730
Doesn't the sight of me frighten you?

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:20.810
You saved us. It would
be rude to be afraid of you.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:26.690
You're a strange child.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:36.310
I am Rudeus Greyrat.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.650
Ruijerd Superdia.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:46.400
Excuse me.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.100
Umm... Where are we?

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:56.400
Biegoya, in the northeast
of the Demon Continent.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:03.230
It looks like we've come an awfully long way.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:07.770
How long will it take to get back
to the Central Continent from here?

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:10.690
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:16.190
I think we got caught up
in a large mana disaster.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:17.940
Don't worry.

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:21.100
I will escort you back to your homeland.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:36.940
Abandoning you here would
damage the Superd tribe's reputation.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:41.480
Of course, our reputation is already in tatters.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:48.230
Eris! Good morning. This is...

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.600
A S-S-Su...

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.520
Superd! It's a Superd!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:54.150
No! I'm scared!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:56.060
Scared, scared, scared!

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.150
Ghislaine! Ghislaine!

00:07:58.150 --> 00:08:00.310
Where are you?!

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.690
I'm sorry, Rudeus! I'm sorry!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.400
I'm sorry I pushed you!

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.150
I'm sorry I broke my promise!

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.980
I'm s-sorry...

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:15.400
That's a normal reaction.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.520
Am I abnormal?

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.980
You are.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:21.770
But...

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.020
...not in a bad way.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.940
N-Nice...

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.650
Nice to...

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.850
...meet you...

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:38.270
I-I'm Eris Bo-Bo-Boreas Greyrat.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:41.350
Eris Boboboreas Greyrat?

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:44.690
No! "Boreas"!

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.230
I just stuttered a little!

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:51.980
I'm sorry.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:57.190
I'm Ruijerd Superdia.

00:08:57.190 --> 00:09:01.730
We can all be friends
if we understand each other.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.650
Mother is such a liar!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:08.810
She said a Superd would
eat me if I stayed up late!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.310
So you curled up and pretended to be asleep?

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:12.730
Don't make fun of me!

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:17.270
Ruijerd might be your friend if you asked him.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.940
But...

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:23.520
Please say something, too, Ruijerd.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:25.850
O-Okay.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:29.400
Let's be friends, Eris.

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:32.900
I-I guess I've got no choice!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.400
I'll be your friend!

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:39.350
And so, the two of them
became good friends overnight.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.690
Eris is losing her fear,
but even when she's rude,

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:45.150
Ruijerd just brushes it off.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:49.730
Who spread the rumor that
the Superd have short tempers?

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.190
We're stranded in a strange land.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.270
I guess we've got a long journey ahead.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:02.850
I've got to make sure Eris gets home.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.230
The Demon Continent!

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:23.060
It's the start of an adventure!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.400
I told you not to move.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.690
How did you know there was
a monster if you couldn't see it?!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.440
I can see them with the eye in my forehead.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.850
That's handy!

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:31.060
I've wished many times that I didn't have it.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:33.060
I wouldn't mind taking it, then!

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.190
Tear it off!

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:36.190
I can't do that.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:38.440
I hope she's joking.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:40.980
If I had a sword, I could fight, too!

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:44.190
And I can help a little using magic.

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.900
Children shouldn't worry about that.

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.940
Just stay safe with your big brother.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:51.400
" <i>Big</i> brother"?!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:54.100
I'm the older sister here!

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.150
Is that so? Sorry.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:58.770
Poor Ruijerd.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:02.190
There it is.

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:04.310
A village!

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:11.520
They look suspicious!
I can't let them into the village!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.980
You would abandon children?

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:18.400
Rowin, they were caught in
a disaster and blown all the way here.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.480
Hey!

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:20.940
What's he saying?

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:24.900
He says we can't go in
because we look suspicious.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.690
No.

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.440
Rowin,

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:30.980
you...

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.600
He'll call the chief.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.310
He'll let you in once we talk.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.600
Umm...

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.020
Telepathy.

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:52.270
The Migurd tribe can talk even at a distance.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:53.520
The Migurd tribe...

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:56.730
Chief, please.

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:59.230
Those children?

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:03.150
Hello, I am Rudeus Greyrat.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.020
You're certainly polite.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:07.650
I'm so glad I learned to speak Demon-God!

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:10.810
I am Rokkus, the chief.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:14.440
Where did you get that necklace?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.980
What, he speaks Human?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.730
My master gave it to me.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.350
Oh? Your master?

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:22.770
Her name is Roxy.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:25.060
Roxy?!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.150
Umm... Is something wrong?

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:31.150
Roxy...

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:33.600
Roxy is...

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.980
my daughter's name!

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.350
Huh?

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:42.100
This is Roxy's hometown?!

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:54.150
Rudeus! A weird thing's guarding the fields!

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.190
Look, look!

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:58.020
They're actually tortoise shells!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.810
One Roxy.

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:04.230
Two Roxys.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:06.940
Three Roxys. Four.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:10.060
Calm down. My goddess is...

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.560
Roxy,

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:16.190
my daughter, hasn't been in touch
since she left over 20 years ago.

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.100
20 years?

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:22.150
How long do the Migurd live for?

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:25.480
We live to about 200, if nothing goes wrong.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:29.020
This year, she'll be...

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:32.190
...44, I think.

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:36.940
By the way, Roxy really is safe, isn't she?

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:38.400
Yes.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:39.770
Where is she?

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.810
Her letter said she was in the Shirone Kingdom.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:43.650
She's well?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.650
Yes, I think so.

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:49.600
I see.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.600
As long as she's well.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:53.810
Thank goodness.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.350
Father-in-law.

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:03.480
I wonder if Paul and the others
would cry if they found out we're safe.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.480
I see.

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:12.270
We saw shooting stars flying
every which way last night

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:15.440
and sensed that something was amiss.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.650
Thank you for the meal!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.060
What is going on?

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.730
You seem close.

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:44.440
Thank you.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:48.690
Now, how do you intend to get home?

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:50.440
I'll go with them.

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:53.270
I won't leave them alone.

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:56.770
And what do you plan to do while with them?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:01.940
There's nothing to plan.
I'll protect them and see them both home.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.850
But you can't enter cities.

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:05.770
Huh?!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:08.730
You can't?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.810
I'll help them if anything happens.

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:16.440
Even if I must kill everyone else there.

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:23.900
As usual, you're blind
when it comes to children.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:28.980
Hasn't it been about ten years
since you saved that one?

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:38.850
But will you be able to accomplish
your goal with that forceful approach?

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.150
Umm...

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:43.230
What is his goal?

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:51.650
Ruijerd aims to dispel the
Superd tribe's poor reputation.

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:56.480
That... seems impossible.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.810
Even Roxy warned me.

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:03.520
Fear of the Superd is probably
deeply rooted in this world.

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:05.810
Just look at how scared Eris was.

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:10.230
But the Superd tribe attacked everyone
in the war, no matter who they were.

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:11.730
That's true, right?

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:13.810
It is not!

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:16.100
It is not true!

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:20.440
That was Laplace's scheme.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.650
L-Laplace?

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:28.940
He betrayed us.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:33.940
Could you tell me more?

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.690
And then,

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:42.900
Ruijerd began to tell me a story
from the dark side of history.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.440
Spears?

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.690
Yes.

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:51.850
During the war, he gave us spears.

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:54.400
Our spears are our souls.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:59.940
Some of us refused to abandon
our spears and use new ones.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.560
The war 400 years ago.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:08.650
The hero Laplace unified the demon race
and won rights from the humans.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.810
The Superd tribe fought for him.

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:16.650
In the end, Ruijerd and his men
accepted the spears he awarded them.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:19.150
Those spears were strong.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:22.850
They seemed unbeatable.

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:27.690
But... we began to change.

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:35.270
Before we knew it, we'd begun to attack
anyone around us, friend and foe alike.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:38.980
But none of us had doubts.

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:42.150
None of us noticed the change.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:44.020
Soon,

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:49.350
we were killing every person we could see.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.690
And finally,

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:58.230
we killed our parents, our wives, our siblings,

00:18:58.230 --> 00:19:01.730
and even our own children.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:10.190
This spear is the soul of my son,

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:14.900
who gave his life to save me from the curse.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:19.690
The infamy of the Superd is our punishment

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:24.900
for carelessly trusting Laplace
and accepting his cursed spears.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:32.190
That's why, as the leader of our warriors,
I must clear our name.

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:40.190
Four hundred years.

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:43.230
Has he been alone that whole time?

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:47.900
Was he full of regret? Was he miserable?

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.600
Regret, huh?

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:01.480
I understand.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.190
If a human child like me helps you,

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:06.770
it might make a difference.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.310
I'll help you.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.440
I promise.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.770
I'll do all that I can.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.270
Thanks.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:28.650
Going already?

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:30.020
Yes.

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.190
And who is this?

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.310
My wife.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.150
My name is Rokari.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:36.060
Master's mother?!

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:37.350
You're so young.

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:41.560
Oh, no, I'm 102 this year.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.480
That's... still young.

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:46.440
If you see Roxy, tell her
to visit once in a while.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.900
I will.

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:52.100
May I call you father-in-law?

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:52.980
No.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.310
Right!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.810
Joking aside, use this if you like.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.230
Take this, too.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:00.060
Whoops.

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:04.730
They're thanks for letting us know Roxy is safe.

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.980
Thank you very much!

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:15.480
Thank you for your kindness!

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:18.350
You're welcome.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:32.520
I promised to help Ruijerd.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:38.520
The old me would have just laughed at his story.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:42.310
But last night, I decided to believe him.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:47.100
His story struck a chord with me.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:50.900
He'll protect us outside of towns;
we'll help him inside them.

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:53.150
It's give-and-take.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:22:00.520
Ruijerd! I look forward to traveling with you.

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:02.600
Yes.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.010
Episode 9

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.010
A Chance Encounter

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:47.030
Next time

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:47.030
The Value of a Life and the First Job
